	(text "Q901: source 1/2/3 = FUSED input; drain 5 = protected output; gate 4.\nLM74700 blocks reverse polarity/backfeed. It has no forward current limit or output disconnect.\nForward inrush flows through the MOSFET body diode before gate enhancement; verify SOA."
		(at 20.32 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid 2160c02c-5e87-59c1-8dbb-7653f6d84e3d)
	)
	(text "D901: BIDIRECTIONAL 14 V TVS before Q901; 23.2 V clamp at 25.9 A / 10-1000 us / 25 C.\nNot sustained overvoltage protection. Confirm hot clamp, wiring overshoot and fuse clearing.\nOnly the controller stage is selected; J901 and F901/F902/F903 remain provisional."
		(at 20.32 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid 6886dbb8-f807-5229-b53b-c80029cd30c7)
	)
	(text "Q901: 2.4 mOhm max at VGS=10 V, 25 C; conduction 0.96 W at 20 A / 1.50 W at 25 A.\nHot resistance, copper spreading, terminal rating and startup must be checked before fabrication.\nSee INPUT_PROTECTION.md for assumptions, source data and bench acceptance criteria."
		(at 20.32 226.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid ce0cb16f-0be9-5175-9b0e-1b65de5ad8cd)
	)
